  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2019-01-18T16:13:04.626Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "Giving Users a monthly subscription service that would bring revenue in for VRChat and give users a way of supporting the Devs.\n\nOther people have submitted similar proposals but I just want a membership scheme, no increased poly count BS and all the other stuff. Just a small icon above someone's head or an extra rank to say that you're a member or public events exclusive to supporters. Simple things to let users who want to support the game, actually support the game and in return, have the satisfaction of being a supporter for the game. \n\nThe bottom line is that the more money VRChat has directly affects the development of the game and everyone on here is asking for one thing or another to be added but it's just not possible to quickly iterate on that and add features all the time. The money from those supporters would mean better servers and more of them, allowing them to bring things like the Client-side IK back which they implemented a few weeks ago but had to remove due to server strain. Everyone here wants this game to succeed and I would be happy to lend a bit of cash every month to make sure that happens.",
